          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Maritime route interruptions force firms to accelerate procurement from substitute or secondary suppliers with shorter vetting cycles, increasing the likelihood of integrating hardware/software with weaker provenance and raising information-security vulnerabilities." />
