          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rising perceived risk of escalation in the US–Iran confrontation drives diversion of ISR assets, liaison officers and analytic bandwidth to the Middle East, degrading the timeliness and completeness of intelligence exchange focused on the Russia–Ukraine front." />
