          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A faster, higher-volume stream of reports, leaks, and commentary about the US–Iran confrontation draws newsroom resources and social amplification, increasing coverage that explicitly links the conflict to great‑power tech competition and boosting media attention on the US–China tech rivalry." />
