          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="War-related disruptions to energy supplies and higher electricity prices raise operating and capital costs for semiconductors and data centers, worsening investor sentiment toward capital-intensive segments of the U.S.-China tech competition." />
