          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Improved timeliness and quality of shared intelligence enables earlier warning, better threat cueing and coordinated engagement, increasing the operational interception and mitigation performance of air/missile defenses protecting chokepoints." />
