          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Improved intelligence-sharing about malicious activity and supply-chain risks stemming from the war supplies regulators with concrete evidence that prompts expanded investigations, audits, and restrictions on foreign technology vendors." />
