          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A deterioration in investor sentiment toward firms exposed to the tech rivalry tightens capital and credit for maintenance and resilience projects at chokepoint facilities, increasing the probability of supply-disrupting failures or deferred upgrades." />
