          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in strikes and attacks in and around maritime chokepoints directly forces ship operators to suspend transits, reroute, seek naval escort, or cancel port calls, producing immediate route interruptions and delays." />
