          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Improved, integrated defenses around chokepoints reduce the operational payoff of coordinated kinetic-plus-information campaigns, lowering incentives for actors to mount large-scale hybrid operations that rely on creating physical disruption as a force multiplier." />
