          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Demonstrable improvements in air/missile defenses reduce political incentives to block or tightly regulate foreign suppliers of critical components, lowering the intensity of regulatory investigations and restrictions on technology links." />
